        "199077111f371ceade41": "I have seen very few eggs retrieved from Feralas in extraordinary condition. These are eggs of the rarest sort...",
        "b497156b7b9ca614ce75": "Well now, you have one--amazing!$B$BI hope you always remember the good you have done today."
